@archive 0001
@size 3

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"길을 막고 있는 문이\n있어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"저걸로는 지나갈 수\n없어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"누가 왜 여기에\n이런 걸 설치했을까?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Noism
	"내가 알려 주지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Noism
	"파란 팔과 빨간 팔을 가진\n덩치 큰 녀석이…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"문을 잠갔다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"파란 팔과 빨간 팔을 가진\n녀석이라…\n설마 스페이드 매그너스인가?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"음… 내가 마지막으로 들었을 땐\n아직 우주에 있었는데."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Noism
	"그 장치를 통해\n어딘가로 갔다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"전송 기록:\n스페이드 매그너스 R…\nWAZA 중앙 본부 사이버 코어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"헤헷!\n거봐, 스페이드 매그너스였어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"그런데 ‘R’은 무슨 뜻이지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"나도 모르겠지만, 직접 만나 보면\n알게 되겠지!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 녀석을 찾지 못하면\n앞으로 나아갈 수 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"WAZA 중앙 본부 사이버 코어…\n이것만으로는 알기 어렵네."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"거기에 도착하면\n그곳 전체를 뒤져 보는 수밖에.\n일단은 이 정도면 됐어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"좋아!\n일단 돌아가자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"신비한 전파 생명체가\n노이즈 웨이브에서 와자로\n전송되어 왔다는 거네?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"수상한데…\n재밌기도 하겠어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
